# Driver telemetry captures. Raw MCP/log dumps are megabytes of machine output
# and belong on the machine that produced them, not in the tree. The analysis
# that cites them stays committed (tools/asfw_sim/FINDINGS.md, captures/*.md);
# asfw_sim's importer tests skip when the raw JSON is absent.
/capture_died.json
/raw_mcp_dump_died_new.json
/mcp_log_query.json
/mcp_log_query_latest.json
/captures/**/*.json
